/surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>O&#x02019;Neill</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Goodhead</surname><given-names>DT</given-names></name><name><surname>Terrissol</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Computational modelling of low-energy electron-induced DNA damage by early physical and chemical events</article-title><source>Int. J. Radiat. Biol.</source><year>1997</year><volume>71</volume><fpage>467</fpage><lpage>483</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9191891</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sutherland</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><name><surname>Bennett</surname><given-names>PV</given-names></name><name><surname>Sidorkina</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Laval</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clustered DNA damages induced in isolated DNA and in human cells by low doses of ionizing radiation</article-title><source>Proc. Natl Acad. Sci. USA</source><year>2000</year><volume>97</volume><fpage>103</fpage><lpage>108</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10618378</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sutherland</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><name><surname>Bennett</surname><given-names>PV</given-names></name><name><surname>Sutherland</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Laval</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clustered DNA damages induced by X-rays in human cells</article-title><source>Radiat. Res.</source><year>2002</year><volume>157</volume><fpage>611</fpage><lpage>616</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12005538</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-c